      "source_id": "src-0fc8ced2da30",
      "text": "What AgentKit Core does\nAgentKit Core is an open-source runtime for building tool-using agents. It provides a scheduler, a tool registry and a trace viewer. It is a developer library, not an end-user application.\nThe workflow\nAgentKit Core works inside the agent orchestration that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
